{
  "id": "cl1entOnb0ardKit",
  "name": "New Client Onboarding Kit",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## New Client Onboarding Kit\n\n**How to use:** open `http://localhost:5678/form/client-onboarding` (or click *Execute workflow* to test) and submit the new client's details.\n\n**Flow:** Form -> Config -> Google Drive client folder + subfolders -> Trello board (To Do / In Progress / Waiting on Client / Done) with an *Onboarding checklist* card -> Calendar **kickoff hold** (no invite sent) -> **Gmail welcome draft** (never auto-sent) -> optional row in a *Clients* sheet -> Slack summary -> confirmation page with all links.\n\n**Before activating:**\n1. *Config* -> `PARENT_FOLDER_ID` (Drive folder for client folders, blank = My Drive), `SCHEDULING_LINK`, `EXEC_NAME`.\n2. Optional: `CLIENTS_SHEET_ID` to log each client (headers: Date, Client, Company, Email, Service, Start Date, Drive Folder, Trello Board).\n3. Edit `CHECKLIST` / `SUBFOLDERS` to match your process.",
        "height": 470,
        "width": 540,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -640,
        -560
      ],
      "name": "Setup Notes",
      "id": "a5201209-0409-565b-b4bc-8c694f0f2833"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "formTitle": "New client onboarding",
        "formDescription": "Sets up Drive, Trello, a kickoff hold and a welcome email draft for a new client.",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Client name",
              "placeholder": "e.g. Carla Reyes",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Company",
              "placeholder": "e.g. BrightPath Co."
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Client email",
              "fieldType": "email",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Service",
              "fieldType": "dropdown",
              "fieldOptions": {
                "values": [
                  {
                    "option": "Executive Assistant support"
                  },
                  {
                    "option": "Inbox & calendar management"
                  },
                  {
                    "option": "Travel coordination"
                  },
                  {
                    "option": "Other"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Start date",
              "fieldType": "date",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Notes",
              "fieldType": "textarea",
              "placeholder": "Anything the kickoff should cover"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "path": "client-onboarding",
          "buttonLabel": "Submit",
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        -600,
        0
      ],
      "name": "Form: New Client",
      "webhookId": "e4983da3-5956-5a46-9dc3-b26102b6ac2f",
      "id": "0523091a-2aed-5e73-b726-4456a02ebe6e"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// ---------- CONFIG ----------\nconst PARENT_FOLDER_ID = '';          // Drive folder that holds client folders ('' = My Drive root)\nconst SUBFOLDERS = ['01 Contracts', '02 Invoices', '03 Deliverables', '04 Meeting Notes'];\nconst TRELLO_LISTS = ['To Do', 'In Progress', 'Waiting on Client', 'Done'];\nconst CHECKLIST = [\n  'Send welcome email',\n  'Collect signed agreement',\n  'Get access: email, calendar, shared drives',\n  'Confirm communication channel and working hours',\n  'Hold kickoff call',\n  'Set up recurring weekly check-in',\n];\nconst KICKOFF_TIME = '10:00';         // local time on the start date\nconst KICKOFF_MINUTES = 30;\nconst TZ = 'Asia/Manila';\nconst SCHEDULING_LINK = '';           // e.g. your Calendly / Google booking page ('' = omit)\nconst EXEC_NAME = 'Marvin';\nconst CLIENTS_SHEET_ID = '';          // optional Google Sheet to log clients ('' = skip)\n// ----------------------------\n\nconst f = $json;\nconst client = String(f['Client name'] || '').trim();\nconst company = String(f['Company'] || '').trim();\nconst email = String(f['Client email'] || '').trim().toLowerCase();\nconst label = company ? `${company} (${client})` : client;\nlet start = DateTime.fromISO(String(f['Start date'] || ''), { zone: TZ });\nif (!start.isValid) start = $now.setZone(TZ).plus({ days: 1 });\nconst [hh, mm] = KICKOFF_TIME.split(':').map(Number);\nconst kickoff = start.set({ hour: hh, minute: mm || 0, second: 0, millisecond: 0 });\n\nreturn [{ json: {\n  client, company, email, label, service: f['Service'] || '', notes: String(f['Notes'] || '').trim(),\n  startDate: start.toISODate(), kickoffStart: kickoff.toISO(), kickoffEnd: kickoff.plus({ minutes: KICKOFF_MINUTES }).toISO(),\n  PARENT_FOLDER_ID, SUBFOLDERS, TRELLO_LISTS, CHECKLIST, TZ, SCHEDULING_LINK, EXEC_NAME, CLIENTS_SHEET_ID,\n  folderBody: { name: `Client - ${label}`, mimeType: 'application/vnd.google-apps.folder', ...(PARENT_FOLDER_ID ? { parents: [PARENT_FOLDER_ID] } : {}) },\n} }];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -380,
        0
      ],
